  "title": "美国政府关闭伊朗 36 个 com/net 媒体网站",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>25</span><font>2021.06</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>美国政府关闭伊朗 36 个 com/net 媒体网站</h2> <b>2021.06.25</b> <section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">近36家伊朗媒体网站显然已被美国政府关闭。</span></section><p><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></section><section><img class=\"rich_pages\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqPzJxoFaUuucewibPiaJtDvAibSs7X0cVLMII68vFDNLib9VYp6hUlV3wr0OX84rGFaia4fyguhdbVUg3ibskHBbwJg/640?wx_fmt=png&tp=webp&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1\" alt=\"图片\"/></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">其中一个被查封的网站是这样子的......（</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">图片来源：PressTV 网站）</span></span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px;\">周二上午，伊朗的PressTV、Al-Masirah电视台、Al-Alam电视台、Al-Maalomah通讯社以及巴林的Lualua电视台等其他媒体的.com和.net网站都显示了一条消息，称这些网站已被美国工业和安全局、出口执法办公室以及联邦调查局（FBI）联合查封，这是一起协调统筹的行动。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px;\"><br/></span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px;\">到目前为止，美国此次行动似乎取得了一定的成效。大多数媒体网站干脆切换到了.ir域名， PressTV现在也使用.co.uk域名来运作，不过有人怀疑这两种做法都不会持续很长时间。这家电台炮轰了美国政府。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><br/></span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">美国司法部已证实，美国政府确实关闭了伊朗网站。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px;\"><br/></span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px;\">司法部声称，查封这些网站“是由于伊朗政权以美国的选举进程为目标，在网上肆意散布虚假信息，并执行旨在误导美国选民的恶意影响行动，厚颜无耻地企图在选民当中制造不和。”</span></section></p><p><br/></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_r\"> <dl> <a href=\"874.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>展会 | GreatSQL精彩亮相GOTC 2025 共建开源数据库生态新未来</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"873.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>解决方案 | 200+系统信创改造！万里数据库助力中信银行信用卡中心实现高效平滑迁移</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"872.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>喜报｜中国移动中标三连！万里数据库彰显全域布局实力</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
